# Face animations of a head, one after another (Xardas in the default save, the camera at his face):
# what the moods of the AI lines look like. Then two of them while he speaks (with lip sync).
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 150 0
cam face 45 15 1
wait 800
rec neutral
wait 600
faceanim nearest S_FRIENDLY 1500
rec friendly
wait 800
faceanim nearest S_ANGRY 1500
rec angry
wait 800
faceanim nearest S_HOSTILE 1500
rec hostile
wait 800
faceanim nearest S_FRIGHTENED 1500
rec frightened
wait 800
faceanim nearest T_HURT 1500
rec hurt
wait 800
faceanim nearest S_EYESCLOSED 1500
rec eyesclosed
wait 800
stop
wait 800
faceanim nearest S_ANGRY 9000
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec angry_talk
wait 4000
faceanim nearest S_FRIENDLY 5000
rec friendly_talk
wait 4000
stop
